  questTitle: The Force Field Authentication
  questDescription: There's a Force Field System that protects us. But recently, the system outside the campus has gone haywire, which caused people and other creatures to mutate. Fortunately, the Force Field protecting the campus is still stable. Still, I need you to check on the Force Field Systems in the other areas. If you can authenticate the other Force Field Systems, you can increase its power.
